# Basic tests that, unlike upstream's (see ../xzdec/), also run on Windows.
# The input files come from upstream's test suite.
#

: version-banner
:
$* --version >>~/EOO/
/xzdec \(XZ Utils\) [0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+/
/liblzma [0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+/
EOO

: decompress-xz
:
$* $src_base/good-1-check-crc32.xz >>EOO
Hello
World!
EOO

: corrupt-input
:
: Test that the integrity check failure is detected.
:
$* $src_base/bad-1-check-crc32.xz >- 2>>~/EOE/ != 0
/.+bad-1-check-crc32\.xz: File is corrupt/
EOE
